!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Isolated nuclei were subjected to tagmentation with Tn5 transposase and library construction with the Nextera DNA Library Prep Kit (Illumina)
!Sample_data_processing = ATAC-seq reads were first trimmed by Trim Galore (v0.4.5) to remove adapter sequences. The trimmed reads were aligned to mm9 by Bowtie(v2.2.2) with the parameters: -N 1 -L 25 -X 2000 –no-mixed –no-discordant.All unmapped reads and PCR duplicates were removed. Non-uniquely mapped reads were assigned to the position with the best matched score. All ATAC sites were called by the MACS2(v2.1.1) callpeak function with the parameters –nolambda –nomodel.
!Sample_data_processing = genome build: mm9
!Sample_data_processing = WIG
!Sample_data_processing = Base-calling was performed using bcl2fastq2-v2.20.0
