!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = CRISPR knock-out (KO) was performed via delivery of CAS9 and sgRNA to LLC cells.  When indicated, cells were selected using standard agents (blasticidin, puromycin, hygromycin). Cells were then inoculated into the flanks of recipient WT mice, expanded in vivo for 15 days without PD1/CTLA-4 treatment, and then harvested.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = All cell lines were tested for mycoplasma and cultured in RPMI (VWR) or DMEM media (Gibco) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS) and antibiotics.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Following harvest of tumors, CD45+ immune cells were enriched with positive selection using MACS beads/columns and isolated as single cells using droplet-based instrumentation (10x Chromium).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single-cell RNA sequencing libraries were constructed with 10x chromium 3' reagents.
!Sample_data_processing = cellranger (version 3.0.1) mkfastq was run on defaults to demultiplex bcl files. Cellranger counts was used to generate filtered_feature_matrix.h5
!Sample_data_processing = genome build: Genome Reference Consortium Mouse Build 38 release 93
!Sample_data_processing = cellranger filtered_feature_matrix .h5
