!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = CRISPR knock-out (KO) was performed via delivery of CAS9 and sgRNA to B16 cells.  When indicated, cells were selected using standard agents (blasticidin, puromycin, hygromycin). No additional treatments were administered.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = All cell lines were tested for mycoplasma and cultured in RPMI (VWR) or DMEM media (Gibco) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS) and antibiotics.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Approximately one million cells per sample were resuspended in RLT lysis buffer with ß-mercaptoethanol (1:100 dilution) and total RNA was isolated using an RNeasy Kit. 
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Poly(A)-enriched sequencing libraries were constructed with the NEBNext Ultra RNA Library Prep Kit (New England Biolabs).
!Sample_description = B16_counts_GRCM38_experiment2.txt
