!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Following harvest of tumors, CD4+/CD8+ immune cells were enriched with positive selection using MACS beads/columns and isolated as single cells using droplet-based instrumentation (10x Chromium).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single-cell RNA sequencing libraries were constructed with 10x chromium 5' reagents.
!Sample_data_processing = cellranger (version 3.0.1) mkfastq was run on defaults to demultiplex bcl files. Cellranger vdj (version 3.1.0) was used to generate single-cell V(D)J sequences and annotations using cellrangers refdata-cellranger-vdj-GRCm38-alts-ensembl-3.1.0 reference
!Sample_data_processing = Cellranger vdj all_contig_annotations.csv file of clonotype abundances
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Grcm38
!Sample_data_processing = Base-calling was performed using bcl2fastq2-v2.20.0
!Sample_platform_id = GPL19057
!Sample_contact_name = Jingyi,,Wu
!Sample_contact_laboratory = Bernstein Lab
!Sample_contact_department = Department of Cancer Biology
