!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = CRISPR knock-out (KO) was performed via delivery of CAS9 and sgRNA to LLC cells.  When indicated, cells were selected using standard agents (blasticidin, puromycin, hygromycin). Cells were then inoculated into both sides of the back of WT recipient mice, expanded in vivo for 14 or 18 days (+/- PD-1/CTLA-4 blockade), and then harvested.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = All cell lines were tested for mycoplasma and cultured in RPMI (VWR) or DMEM media (Gibco) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS) and antibiotics.
