!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = All cell lines were tested for mycoplasma and cultured in RPMI (VWR) or DMEM media (Gibco) supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS) and antibiotics.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was  isolated using an RNeasy Micro kit (Qiagen). TCR profiling from RNA was performed using the SMARTer Mouse TCR a/b Profiling Kit (Takara)
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = llumina sequencing primers were added in a semi-nested approach during TCR amplification; libraries were purified, pooled and then sequenced on an illumina Miseq platform
!Sample_data_processing = fastq files were aligned and clonotypes assembled using mixcr analyze amplicon (version 3.0.13) using flags -s mmu --starting-material rna --5-end no-v-primers --3-end c-primers --adapters adapters-present
!Sample_data_processing = Mixcr .clonotypes.ALL.txt files of clonotype abundance
